==Problem description==
Diagnosis and repair of an iPhone 12 that will not allow you to adjust the brightness of the display.
[[File:Placeholder image.jpg|thumb|Example image (Figure 1) -- No image yet. Help expand this page by uploading it!]]
==Symptoms==

*Phone shows Apple logo at full brightness
*Once it gets to the home screen the display gets really dark
*May be confused with "no backlight"

==Solution==

* Connect the ear speaker flex to get the brightness to work.

* if it still does not work, then the original ear speaker flex may be bad.
** In this case, try a new ear speaker flex (but you will lose Face ID)
Video explanation: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ShqQwVfsBcU